  "description": "A drop-in, themeable WPF help center (customer portal) control for the\n      Beacon support platform. Renders the knowledge base, request submission and\n      ticket tracking from a single <BeaconHelpCenter> control. Point it at\n      your Beacon API base URL and your app's portal key, set a brand colour, and\n      embed it anywhere in your own WPF app. A faithful port of the Blazor\n      Kiwicodes.Beacon.HelpCenter, backed by Kiwicodes.Beacon.Sdk's\n      BeaconPublicClient for all public/* endpoints.",
